body:
I should note, if you explicitly set `_source` in your update it works as expected:

``` js
PUT /data/_mapping/data
{
   "_source": {
      "enabled": false
   },
   "properties": {
      "long": {
         "type": "long"
      }
   }
}
```

Same thing goes for `_parent`:

```
PUT t 
{
  "mappings": {
    "parent": {},
    "child": {
      "_parent": {
        "type": "parent"
      }
    }
  }
}

PUT t/_mapping/child
{
  "properties": {}
}
```

Returns:

```
{
  "error": {
    "root_cause": [
      {
        "type": "illegal_argument_exception",
        "reason": "The _parent field's type option can't be changed: [parent]->[null]"
      }
    ],
    "type": "illegal_argument_exception",
    "reason": "The _parent field's type option can't be changed: [parent]->[null]"
  },
  "status": 400
}
```
